


   =====( ListNodes V1.00 )==========================================


        Trion 'ListNodes' Utility/Door.

        (c) Copyright Paul Spijkerman, '94-'97. All rights reserved.

        Written for use with the Trion BBS package.


   ===================================================================


   Listnodes is a programm that will give a list with all BBS nodes
   running with the current BBS action and the name, place and
   level of the user on that system.


   You can use it from shell by typing listnodes, or use it
   as a door.
   Add something like this to your menus to use it as a door:


   Cmd "L" , 0-255
      CliDoor  "tron:utils/listnodes ANSI"
      More
   EndCmd


   When you type ANSI on the command line, the utility
   will use colors in the list and use IBM character set
   characters for the line.
   Which is usefull in a door, but not very practical in
   a shell.

